1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:08,460
In Mexico City, elderly women living alone were being found dead in their own homes. Many seem to have let their killer in.

2
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:11,070
They had opened the door themselves.

3
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:20,630
The press called the killer La Mataviejitas: the little old lady killer. For years, police hunted a man… perhaps a man disguised as a woman.

4
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:21,960
They were wrong.

5
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:29,300
On January 25, 2006, a woman was caught fleeing the home of an eighty-two-year-old victim.

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:38,010
Her name was Juana Barraza. On weekends, she was a professional wrestler: La Dama del Silencio. The Lady of Silence.

7
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:48,620
Investigators believed she got inside by posing as a social worker. She was convicted of sixteen murders and sentenced to 759 years.

8
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:58,969
But authorities linked her to as many as forty deaths. The killer everyone was looking for… was the one nobody suspected. This is Plot Twist with A&R.

